# Metallic-RC Dorm layout: where the game's own Dorm prefabs go.
# The 2026 client keeps this in its scrambled level files, so this file is ours: built from the pieces the game
# authors in place (floor, floor trims, wall stripe, back wall, pillar: they give the room's edges) and fitted to
# the 2026 Dorm by eye. Room: x -4.85..4.85, z -2.96..2.96 (the left end, x < -2.46, is a loft alcove z -2.83..2.83).
# name                          x      y      z     yaw  pitch  roll   (metres, degrees, client space)

# walls: the full-height pieces; their _Up/_Down halves are alternatives and stay out
(Dorm_Wall_4)                  2.32   0.00  -2.96     0
(Dorm_Wall_1)                 -4.88   0.00   0.00    90
(Dorm_Wall_3)                  4.88   0.00  -1.46   -90
(Dorm_Wall_Loft_1)            -3.88   0.00  -2.83     0
(Dorm_Wall_Loft_2)            -3.44   0.00   2.83   180
(Dorm_Wall_1_Up) hide
(Dorm_Wall_1_Down) hide
(Dorm_Wall_Loft_1_Up) hide
(Dorm_Wall_Loft_1_Down) hide
(Dorm_Wall_Loft_2_Up) hide
(Dorm_Wall_Loft_2_Down) hide

# ceiling
(Dorm_Ceiling_Flat)           -1.85   6.30   0.00     0    -90
(Dorm_Ceiling_Angled)          3.10   6.20   0.00    90    -90
(Dorm_Fluorescent_Light)      -1.00   6.25   0.00     0
(Dorm_Fluorescent_Light)       1.50   6.25   0.00     0

# loft over the left alcove, ladder up from the room
