(Dorm_Loft_Beam)              -2.46   2.74   0.00    90
(Dorm_Loft_Railing)           -2.50   3.15   0.90    90
(Dorm_Loft_Shelves)           -3.66   2.79   0.00    90
(Dorm_Ladder)                 -2.30   0.00  -1.20    90

